{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/2fbc0a35b158f11f21373f35b3b65885.avif?t=1771309360\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras_big/2fbc0a35b158f11f21373f35b3b65885.webp?t=1771309360 width=1560 height=157 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out! Every step brings you closer to survival or death in this horror FPS game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a police officer sent to investigate a mysterious emergency call. But when you arrive, you find only an abandoned graveyard swallowed by shadows\u2026 and something waiting for you in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/5b920d715262158f0e5e2e70167db94e.poster.avif?t=1771309360\" width=802 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/5b920d715262158f0e5e2e70167db94e.webm?t=1771309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/5b920d715262158f0e5e2e70167db94e.mp4?t=1771309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/518767379228d3896aad0b45d294b842.avif?t=1771309360\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras_big/518767379228d3896aad0b45d294b842.webp?t=1771309360 width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat:</strong> Outsmart terrifying creatures that move to your rhythm.<br>Conserve ammo, set traps, and think before you take your next step. Every motion could be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> A forgotten cult. Lost faith.<br>Uncover the truth buried beneath cryptic puzzles and eerie remnants of those who came before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Health and ammo are scarce.<br>Explore carefully, uncover long-buried secrets, and learn what really happened here.<br>You came to help someone\u2026 but you might end up staying for something else entirely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/0fa04745fe0c4e899ce129fa43a2b2f0.poster.avif?t=1771309360\" width=802 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/0fa04745fe0c4e899ce129fa43a2b2f0.webm?t=1771309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/0fa04745fe0c4e899ce129fa43a2b2f0.mp4?t=1771309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game is currently in active development.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the demo will receive regular updates with new improvements, content, and polish as development continues.<br>Our plan is to finish the full demo first (with <strong>monthly updates</strong>)\u00a0and then move on to creating the complete game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736440?t=1771309360","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/c33d096795a85657f61b73f7832e3e25bc4da781/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771309360","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/9feb09c6f7ede2011e2592208c4946d7f8f94680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771309360","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/9feb09c6f7ede2011e2592208c4946d7f8f94680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771309360","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains frequent scenes of violence involving shooting and killing supernatural creatures. Players will encounter dead bodies of police officers in the environment, including one instance where a body is visibly cut in half. However, the game does not include graphic gore or detailed internal organs.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual content, sexual violence, drug or alcohol use, or self-harm."},"demos":[{"appid":3822590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/2fbc0a35b158f11f21373f35b3b65885.avif?t=1771309360\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras_big/2fbc0a35b158f11f21373f35b3b65885.webp?t=1771309360 width=1560 height=157 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out! Every step brings you closer to survival or death in this horror FPS game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a police officer sent to investigate a mysterious emergency call. But when you arrive, you find only an abandoned graveyard swallowed by shadows\u2026 and something waiting for you in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/5b920d715262158f0e5e2e70167db94e.poster.avif?t=1771309360\" width=802 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/5b920d715262158f0e5e2e70167db94e.webm?t=1771309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/5b920d715262158f0e5e2e70167db94e.mp4?t=1771309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/518767379228d3896aad0b45d294b842.avif?t=1771309360\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras_big/518767379228d3896aad0b45d294b842.webp?t=1771309360 width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat:</strong> Outsmart terrifying creatures that move to your rhythm.<br>Conserve ammo, set traps, and think before you take your next step. Every motion could be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles:</strong> A forgotten cult. Lost faith.<br>Uncover the truth buried beneath cryptic puzzles and eerie remnants of those who came before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Health and ammo are scarce.<br>Explore carefully, uncover long-buried secrets, and learn what really happened here.<br>You came to help someone\u2026 but you might end up staying for something else entirely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/0fa04745fe0c4e899ce129fa43a2b2f0.poster.avif?t=1771309360\" width=802 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/0fa04745fe0c4e899ce129fa43a2b2f0.webm?t=1771309360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/0fa04745fe0c4e899ce129fa43a2b2f0.mp4?t=1771309360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game is currently in active development.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the demo will receive regular updates with new improvements, content, and polish as development continues.<br>Our plan is to finish the full demo first (with <strong>monthly updates</strong>)\u00a0and then move on to creating the complete game.</p>","developers":["Martin Demeter","Szabolcs T\u00f3th"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/ffa510c8707bc72320c2ba2473e355d8e1683028/header.jpg?t=1771309360","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736440/1158980317/8b147c74883a97d4123c20bb00db7fc4b044bf93/1760167861/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760168377","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736440/1158980317/8b147c74883a97d4123c20bb00db7fc4b044bf93/1760167861/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760168377","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736440/1158980317/8b147c74883a97d4123c20bb00db7fc4b044bf93/1760167861/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760168377","id":257149400,"name":"Echoes in the Dark_Trailer #1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257149400/b190699bc7d87443e25f7e15e0cd8ef4c2ccdfe2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760168377"}],"name":"Echoes in the Dark","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10 64-bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-2500 @3.3 GHz / AMD FX-8320 @3.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM